      "seed": 308010136,
      "version": 310,
      "versionNonce": 870089448,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791558050806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-__init__(): Initializes the bm25 attribute.\n-index(max_chunk_size: int = 2000) -> None:\n    -Validates the maximum chunk size using validate_chunk_size().\n    -Scans the raw data folder using FileScanner.\n    -Runs files through their respective chunker strategies (PythonChunker,\n     TextChunker, MarkdownChunker).\n    -Displays a tqdm progress bar with calculated throughput (file/s).\n    -Validates output metadata entries against the MinimalSource schema. \n    -Calls self.bm25.indexing() to build and save the final BM25 index and \n    metadata.  ",
      "fontSize": 19.824580478549525,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-__init__(): Initializes the bm25 attribute.\n-index(max_chunk_size: int = 2000) -> None:\n    -Validates the maximum chunk size using validate_chunk_size().\n    -Scans the raw data folder using FileScanner.\n    -Runs files through their respective chunker strategies (PythonChunker,\n     TextChunker, MarkdownChunker).\n    -Displays a tqdm progress bar with calculated throughput (file/s).\n    -Validates output metadata entries against the MinimalSource schema. \n    -Calls self.bm25.indexing() to build and save the final BM25 index and \n    metadata.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
