      "text": "-self.root_dir: Path object pointing to the directory to \n scan (e.g., data/raw/vllm-0.10.1)\n-self.files_by_extension: Dict[str, List[Path]] pre-populated with empty\n lists for keys \".md\", \".txt\", and \".py\".",
      "fontSize": 19.824580478549525,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-self.root_dir: Path object pointing to the directory to \n scan (e.g., data/raw/vllm-0.10.1)\n-self.files_by_extension: Dict[str, List[Path]] pre-populated with empty\n lists for keys \".md\", \".txt\", and \".py\".",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HGjE-dQMif_LFdan4q4ri",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1430.4960977160772,
      "y": -2220.6773217843065,
      "width": 723.57568359375,
      "height": 223.02653038368214,
      "angle": 0,
