      "updated": 1791558050806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-Why it's costly: disk I/O dominates. Do it once per process, not\nonce per question.\n-Missing index: if data/processed/indexing doesn't exist (user ran\nsearch before index), the load raises. Catch it and print \"run index\nfirst\" instead of a traceback.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-Why it's costly: disk I/O dominates. Do it once per process, not once per question.\n-Missing index: if data/processed/indexing doesn't exist (user ran search before index), the load raises. Catch it and print \"run index first\" instead of a traceback.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
