      "originalText": "-self.root_dir: Path object pointing to the directory to \n scan (e.g., data/raw/vllm-0.10.1)\n-self.files_by_extension: Dict[str, List[Path]] pre-populated with empty\n lists for keys \".md\", \".txt\", and \".py\".",
      "autoResize": true,
