      "text": "-read(file_path: str) -> Any:\n opens the file (utf-8) and returns json.load. A missing file raises\n FileNotFoundError, malformed JSON raises JSONDecodeError, a\n directory path ends in an OSError. All are caught in main().\n-__check_file_exist(path): its message says \"directory\" for a file:\n fix the wording.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-read(file_path: str) -> Any:\n opens the file (utf-8) and returns json.load. A missing file raises\n FileNotFoundError, malformed JSON raises JSONDecodeError, a\n directory path ends in an OSError. All are caught in main().\n-__check_file_exist(path): its message says \"directory\" for a file:\n fix the wording.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
