      "seed": 956232353,
      "version": 309,
      "versionNonce": 1826557171,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791896132610,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-iou(truth, found) -> float:\n intersection (clamped at 0) / union. Returns 0 if union is 0.\n End index exclusive: the convention is fixed here.\n-first_match_rank(truth_source, retrieved) -> int | None:\n. It walks the retrieved list in order and returns the 1-based position of the first source\n where is_match is true (same exact file_path, then IoU ≥ 0.05), or “none” if there is no\n match. It stops at the first hit.\n-is_found(truth, retrieved) -> bool:\n True if ANY retrieved source matches. One chunk may satisfy\n several truth sources.",
      "fontSize": 14.712450324685241,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-iou(truth, found) -> float:\n intersection (clamped at 0) / union. Returns 0 if union is 0.\n End index exclusive: the convention is fixed here.\n-first_match_rank(truth_source, retrieved) -> int | None:\n. It walks the retrieved list in order and returns the 1-based position of the first source\n where is_match is true (same exact file_path, then IoU ≥ 0.05), or “none” if there is no\n match. It stops at the first hit.\n-is_found(truth, retrieved) -> bool:\n True if ANY retrieved source matches. One chunk may satisfy\n several truth sources.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
