      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. read both files (FileScanner.read)\n2. validate: StudentSearchResults and GroundTruthDataset\n3. Evaluator(k_values, max_context_length).evaluate(student, truth)\n4. print the report once (return OR print, never both)",
