      "versionNonce": 1392507183,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791637460428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-iou(truth, found) -> float:\n intersection (clamped at 0) / union. Returns 0 if union is 0.\n End index exclusive: the convention is fixed here.\n-is_match(truth, found) -> bool:\n exact file_path equality first (no normalizing), then IoU >= threshold.\n-is_found(truth, retrieved) -> bool:\n True if ANY retrieved source matches. One chunk may satisfy\n several truth sources.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-iou(truth, found) -> float:\n intersection (clamped at 0) / union. Returns 0 if union is 0.\n End index exclusive: the convention is fixed here.\n-is_match(truth, found) -> bool:\n exact file_path equality first (no normalizing), then IoU >= threshold.\n-is_found(truth, retrieved) -> bool:\n True if ANY retrieved source matches. One chunk may satisfy\n several truth sources.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
