      "updated": 1791637460428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-question_id: str: default uuid4 when missing, so it never matches\n-question: str\n-sources: List[MinimalSource]: file_path, first_character_index,\n last_character_index (+ content today, handled later)\n-answer: str: required. Without it the item falls back to\n UnansweredQuestion in RagDataset, and the moulinette crashes\n with: no attribute 'sources'",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-question_id: str: default uuid4 when missing, so it never matches\n-question: str\n-sources: List[MinimalSource]: file_path, first_character_index,\n last_character_index (+ content today, handled later)\n-answer: str: required. Without it the item falls back to\n UnansweredQuestion in RagDataset, and the moulinette crashes\n with: no attribute 'sources'",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
