      "text": "-matcher: SourceMatcher: composition, injected so tests can swap it\n-k_values: List[int]: cleaned (positive, unique, sorted)\n-max_context_length: int = 2000: same limit the moulinette checks\n-count_unanswered_as_zero: bool: TEMPORARY policy switch, delete\n it once the moulinette behavior is confirmed",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-matcher: SourceMatcher: composition, injected so tests can swap it\n-k_values: List[int]: cleaned (positive, unique, sorted)\n-max_context_length: int = 2000: same limit the moulinette checks\n-count_unanswered_as_zero: bool: TEMPORARY policy switch, delete\n it once the moulinette behavior is confirmed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
